  "description": "Su-Gyeom, an ordinary student on vacation, is surprised by his best friend Beom Jin-Hyeong coming out to him. But to be a good and reliable friend, he somehow winds up accompanying his friend to a gay bar. Somehow, he starts wondering about his own sexuality, and their relationship begins flowing in a strange direction...\n\nThe touching relationship between childhood friends Beom Jin-Hyeong and Han Su-Gyeom does not end with one verse. \n\nIs friendship first? Does love come first?\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 3 extra chapters.*",
